### Log‑Base 10 of the Line Count  

Using a high‑precision logarithm routine (`mpmath`) we computed:

\[
\log_{10}(20)\;\approx\;
\boxed{\,1.301029996\,}
\]

(The value shown has been rounded to nine significant digits after the decimal point.)

---

#### Quick note – if you were looking for \(\log_{10}(2)\):

\[
\log_{10}(2)\;\approx\;
\boxed{\,0.301029999\,}
\]
